  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Easter_Egg_Maker?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/36/Easter_Egg_Maker.png/revision/latest?cb=20250926024408\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Easter Egg Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"248\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Easter Egg Maker</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Machine</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 17</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 slot(s)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Easter Egg Maker</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">production building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 17. It was delivered by <a href=\"/wiki/alfred-4276\" title=\"Alfred\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Alfred</a> the Mailman on April 3, 2023. It automatically disappeared after April 17, 2023.\n</p><p>In 2024, it was delivered by the Mailman on March 19, 2024.\n</p><p>In 2025, it was delivered by the Mailman on April 1, 2025.\n</p><p>It does not need to be repaired or bought. It is given for free.\n</p><p>It is used to make various types of easter eggs.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\">2023</span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AEaster_Egg_Maker.png\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker.png (676 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/36/Easter_Egg_Maker.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/149?cb=20250926024408\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker.png (676 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Easter Egg Maker\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Easter Egg Maker.png (676 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Easter Egg Maker\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Easter Egg Maker</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AEaster_Egg_Maker_Mastered.png\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker Mastered.png (278 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/94/Easter_Egg_Maker_Mastered.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20250926025422\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker Mastered.png (278 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Easter Egg Maker Mastered\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Easter Egg Maker Mastered.png (278 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Easter Egg Maker Mastered\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Easter Egg Maker Mastered</div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\">2024</span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AEaster_Egg_Maker_2024.png\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker 2024.png (277 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/01/Easter_Egg_Maker_2024.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240627195631\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker 2024.png (277 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Easter Egg Maker\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Easter Egg Maker 2024.png (277 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Easter Egg Maker\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Easter Egg Maker</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image-no-lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?title=Special%3AUpload\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker 2024 Mastered.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Easter Egg Maker 2024 Mastered.png</span></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Easter Egg Maker Mastered</div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\">2025</span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia