  "wikitext": "{{DISPLAYTITLE:Easter Egg Maker}}{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Easter Egg Maker.png|200px|left|Easter Egg Maker]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Production Buildings|Machine]]\n |level = 17\n |slots = 2\n}}\nThe '''Easter Egg Maker''' is a [[Production Buildings|production building]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 17. It was delivered by [[Alfred]] the Mailman on April 3, 2023. It automatically disappeared after April 17, 2023.\n\nIn 2024, it was delivered by the Mailman on March 19, 2024.\n\nIn 2025, it was delivered by the Mailman on April 1, 2025.\n\nIt does not need to be repaired or bought. It is given for free.\n\nIt is used to make various types of easter eggs.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n=== '''Appearance''' ===\n=== 2023 ===\n<gallery>\nFile:Easter Egg Maker.png|Easter Egg Maker\nFile:Easter Egg Maker Mastered.png|Easter Egg Maker Mastered \n</gallery>\n=== 2024 ===\n<gallery>\nFile:Easter Egg Maker 2024.png|Easter Egg Maker\nFile:Easter Egg Maker 2024 Mastered.png|Easter Egg Maker Mastered\n</gallery>\n=== 2025 ===\n<gallery>\nFile:Easter Egg Maker 2025.png|Easter Egg Maker\n</gallery>\n=== 2026===\n<gallery>\nFile:Easter Egg Maker 2026.png|Easter Egg Maker\nFile:Easter Egg Maker 2026 Mastered.png|Easter Egg Maker Mastered\n</gallery>\n----\n=== '''Products''' ===\n\n=== 2023 ===\n{{Building Products|noPrice=y\n|Indigo Egg|17|30m|20\n|Cherry Egg|25|45m|48\n|Royal Egg|43|1h|56\n|Peacock Egg|54|1:30|59\n}}\n\n=== 2024 ===\n{{Building Products|noPrice=y\n|Chocolate Cow|17|30m|67\n|Chocolate Chicken|20|45m|77\n|Chocolate Pig|40|1h|133\n|Chocolate Goat|55|1:30|166\n}}\n\n=== 2025 ===\n{{Building Products|noPrice=y\n|Chocolate Cow|17|10m|57\n|Chocolate Sheep|17|10m|44\n|Chocolate Bee|19|10m|70\n|Chocolate Chicken|25|10m|100\n|Chocolate Duck|30|10m|145\n|Chocolate Pig|35|10m|79\n|Chocolate Horse|45|10m|122\n|Chocolate Goat|53|10m|79\n}}\n\n=== 2026===\nProducts from the easter egg maker cannot be bought or sold. They can only be loaded onto boats; each boat needing 1-3 per box, except for peacock egg which only 1 per box. They are stored in the [[Barn]].\n----\n=== '''Upgrading''' ===\n{{Main|Production Buildings}}\nThe easter egg maker originally has two slots available. Unlocking more slots costs [[diamond|diamonds]]:\n* 3rd slot: 20 diamonds\n* 4th slot: 32 diamonds\n* 5th slot: 44 diamonds\n* 6th slot: 56 diamonds\n* 7th slot: 68 diamonds\n* 8th slot: 80 diamonds\n* 9th slot: 92 diamonds\n----\n=== '''Mastering''' ===\n=== 2023 ===\nA total of 600 hours of production is required to [[Masteries|master]] the Easter Egg Maker:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 1em 0; border-collapse: collapse;\"\n|-\n|rowspan=\"3\"|[[File:Easter Egg Maker Mastered.png|150px|Mastered Easter Egg Maker]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★<br />150 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★<br />150 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★★<br />300 hrs'''\n|-\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:Easter Egg Maker Mastery I.png|100px]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:Easter Egg Maker Mastery II.png|100px]]\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:Easter Egg Maker Mastery III.png|100px]]\n|-\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''+10% Chocolate bunny from boat orders'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''10% faster''' \n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''+20% Chocolate bunny from boat orders'''\n|}\n\n=== 2024 ===\nA total of ? hours of production is required to [[Masteries|master]] the Easter Egg Maker:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 1em 0; border-collapse: collapse;\"\n|-\n|rowspan=\"3\"|[[File:Easter Egg Maker 2024 Mastered.png|150px|Mastered Easter Egg Maker]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★<br />40 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★<br />? hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★★<br />? hrs'''\n|-\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:Easter Egg Maker Mastery I.png|100px]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:Easter Egg Maker Mastery 2024 II.png|100px]]\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:Easter Egg Maker Mastery III.png|100px]]\n|-\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''+10% Chocolate bunny from boat orders'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''10% faster''' \n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''+20% Chocolate bunny from boat orders'''\n|}\n\n=== 2025 ===\nA total of ? hours of production is required to [[Masteries|master]] the Easter Egg Maker:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 1em 0; border-collapse: collapse;\"\n|-\n|rowspan=\"3\"|[[File:Easter Egg Maker 2025 Mastered.png|150px|Mastered Easter Egg Maker]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★<br />48 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★<br />192 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★★<br />? hrs'''\n|-\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:Easter Egg Maker Mastery I.png|100px]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|{{NoPic}}\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|{{NoPic}}\n|-\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''+10% Chocolate bunny from boat orders'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''+40% Chocolate bunny from boat orders'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''+100% Chocolate bunny from boat orders'''\n|}\n----\n=== '''Strategy tips''' ===\n\n* Easter Egg Maker is temporary production machine. Player should not spend large number of diamonds to unlock all slots, but purchase slots for sufficient production. \n\n----\n=== '''Rewards Catalogue''' ===\nThese exclusive decorations can be redeemed using [[Chocolate Bunny]].\n\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n[[Category:Production Buildings|Easter Egg Maker]]\n\n{{Languages\n|es = Puesto de huevos de Pascua\n|de = Ostereiermaschine\n|ru = Стол для украшения яиц\n}}\n{{DEFAULTSORT:Easter Egg Maker}}",
